After inserting the Store into your model, Plant Simulation shows it with the default dimensions. Clicking
OK then shows it with the settings that you typed into the Configuration Table and propagates the values
to the child objects.
Show the Occupancy of the Supermarket in a Chart
If you drag the Store configured as a Supermarket onto a Chart, it shows the occupancy for all parts that
are defined in the Configuration Table by default.
